"Support the :c:expr:`float complex` and :c:expr:`double complex` C types: "
"formatting characters ``'Zf'`` and ``'Zd'`` respectively. (Contributed by "
"Victor Stinner in :gh:`146151` and :gh:`148675`.)"
msgstr ""
"C の :c:expr:`float complex` 型と :c:expr:`double complex` 型をサポートしまし"
