"書式文字は ``'e'`` です。\n"
"(Sergey B Kirpichev による貢献。:gh:`146238`。)"

msgid ""
"The :data:`array.typecodes` type changed from :class:`str` to :class:`tuple` "
"to support type codes longer than 1 character (``Zf`` and ``Zd``). "
"(Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`148675`.)"
msgstr ""
