":mod:`calendar`'s :ref:`command-line <calendar-cli>` text output has more "
"color. This can be controlled with :ref:`environment variables <using-on-"
"controlling-color>`. (Contributed by Hugo van Kemenade in :gh:`148352`.)"
msgstr ""
":mod:`calendar` の :ref:`コマンドライン <calendar-cli>` のテキスト出力で、色"
