msgstr ""
":func:`difflib.unified_diff` にオプションの *color* パラメーターを導入し、:"
"program:`git diff` のような色付き出力を可能にしました。\n"
":ref:`環境変数 <using-on-controlling-color>` で制御できます。\n"
"(Douglas Thor による貢献。:gh:`133725`。)"

msgid ""
"Improved the styling of HTML diff pages generated by the :class:`difflib."
"HtmlDiff` class, and migrated the output to the HTML5 standard. (Contributed "
"by Jiahao Li in :gh:`134580`.)"
msgstr ""
":class:`difflib.HtmlDiff` クラスが生成する HTML 差分ページのスタイルを改善"
"し、出力を HTML5 標準に移行しました。\n"
"(Jiahao Li による貢献。:gh:`134580`。)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1221
msgid "email"
msgstr "email"

msgid ""
"Email generators now raise an error when an :class:`.EmailMessage` cannot be "
"accurately flattened due to a non-ASCII email address (mailbox) in an "
"address header. Options for supporting Email Address Internationalization "
"(EAI) are discussed in :attr:`.EmailPolicy.utf8`. (Contributed by R David "
