#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1384
msgid "mmap"
msgstr "mmap"

msgid ""
":class:`mmap.mmap` now has a *trackfd* parameter on Windows; if it is "
"``False``, the file handle corresponding to *fileno* will not be duplicated. "
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`78502`.)"
msgstr ""
